# SharedClipboard module version, in the RISC OS VersionNum style.
#
# The Makefile turns this into version.inc, which supplies the module's help
# string. Bump both fields together when the module changes.
#
# The date is deliberate rather than a build stamp: the assembled module is
# committed as poduleroms/sharedclipboard,ffa and only rebuilt when the guest
# ROMs are, so a real build date would record when that last happened rather
# than anything a user could act on.

Module_MajorVersion	0.01
Module_Date		27 Jul 2026
